383
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:37,260
Du bist Harui?

384
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:39,220
Harui Fujioka?

385
00:21:40,680 --> 00:21:41,060
Oh

386
00:21:41,060 --> 00:21:43,960
Ahai, du
